  "id": "bicalutamide",
  "term": "bicalutamide",
  "definition": "Bicalutamide is an anticancer drug examined in prostate cancer cells as part of research on how drugs and tissue stiffness interact. In this study, it was one of several agents with distinct cellular targets, and it was associated with an increase in the cells’ elastic modulus.",
